event: delta
data: {"v":[{"p":"/message/content/parts/0","o":"append","v":". They also support diverse ecosystems, offering habitats for fish, birds, and other wildlife. Throughout history, civilizations have developed near rivers because they provide transportation, food, and opportunities for trade. Famous rivers such as the Nile, Amazon"}]}

event: delta
data: {"v":[{"p":"/message/content/parts/0","o":"append","v":", and Ganges hold great cultural and environmental significance. However, pollution, deforestation, and climate change threaten many rivers today. Protecting rivers through conservation and"}]}

